he la polizia gli ha sequestrato. Quando scopre le abilità di hacker del ventenne Jeremy Peeters, realizza che questo timido ragazzo è la chiave per realizzarlo. Chi avrà davvero il controllo?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Bank Hacker","overview":"After two years in prison, professional con man Alidor Van Praet needs to rebuild the illegal fortune the police seized from him. When he spots 19-year-old Jeremy Peeter’s hacking skills at a computing convention, he knows this shy teenager is the key to making it happen and to get revenge on the financial system that drove his father to suicide.","tagline":"Don't buy revenge. Steal it."},{"language":"nl-NL","overview":"Na twee jaar gevangenisstraf moet de professionele oplichter Alidor Van Praet zijn illegaal vergaarde fortuin weer opbouwen. Als hij op een computerconventie de hackvaardigheden van Jeremy ziet, bedenken ze een even ingenieus als gedurfd plan. Ze zullen trachten de digitale snelweg van geldtransfers tussen banken te kapen, wat honderden miljoenen in contanten kan opleveren. Voor Jeremy is het echter meer dan dat. Dit is zijn kans om wraak te nemen op het financieel systeem dat zijn vader tot zelfmoord dreef."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2nYM2lX5R4hX4xkWibTAIetFipE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mtxA3J070tgb3WfzX8LEVsDPNvG.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Dopo due anni di carcere, il truffatore professionista Alidor Van Praet deve ricostruire la sua fortuna illegale.","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":8,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Puqfel3lkxogzxOasYEhS9mcFu.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/125693/season/1"}],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":125693,"type":"tv","originalLanguage":"nl-NL","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":